 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "I thought I had seen the sunset\nAt twilight in the vineyard's me\nBut all was black and silent\nIn memory of yesterday.\nI saw no moon, nor any\nClouds that shone o'er the shadow\nOf trees to make a shadow\nThat clung round them like sorrow.\nNow my thoughts are wandering\nAbout forgotten situations;\nSo I wonder at life again\nFor some other occasion.",
